        <mxCell id="finding" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#18333e;strokeColor=#4d7682;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Finding:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(24, 51, 62), rgb(178, 202, 211));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Report CJ-603 captures a BRIDGE asset type, which according to the approved destination policy (W06-S03) must be routed to the Structures department. However, the delivery log records show that this work item was incorrectly received by the Electrical department instead (W06-S04). This confirms a routing discrepancy between system policy and actual execution.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;n6owBd awi2gc&quot; aria-owns=&quot;action-menu-parent-container&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; margin: 12px 0px 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Unanswered question:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(24, 51, 62), rgb(178, 202, 211));&quot;&gt;What specific entries or active runtime configurations were present inside the D2 Routing Table when report CJ-603 was processed?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;yhAwj&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;AHmQrc&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;n6owBd awi2gc&quot; aria-owns=&quot;action-menu-parent-container&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 16px; margin: 12px 0px 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="1089" x="40" y="585" as="geometry" />
